  "description": "Empirical tabulation of per-Wedderburn-block binding fractions Δ_λ(K) for K ∈ {D, T, ³He, ⁴He} per the full ρ_K mass formula M(K) = m_e · Σ_λ y_λ · χ^λ · (1 + Δ_λ). Solves the underdetermined Σ c_λ Δ_λ = ΔM/m_e under four ansätze: (a) single-block sweep over all λ ⊢ 3A, (b) shell-supported λ_shell = staircase, (c) Δ-monotonic via content sum c(λ), (d) Δ-isotypic via dim_q(λ)/[n]_q!. Reports best λ* per ansatz, ‖Δ‖₂, and cross-atom recurrence pattern. Proposal 1 of docs/audits/2026-05-09-workplan-update-rho-k.md.",
